<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL>Other Downhole Survey Methods</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  The most likely 'Other Downhole Survey' would be either be a downhole 
flowmeter or a downhole geophysical survey.  However, other surveys should not 
be added by default.  Specific types of downhole surveys should be intentionally 
selected because of their appropriateness to the aplication.  The designer should 
